      "value": "Achivements for contributing (more rare achivements):\n\n* attended Avatar contest X in year Y\n\n* have a curated Package in VCC listed\n\n* contribute for translations\n\n* Reported a bug which got Tracked or Fixed\n\n* Report a Feature Request which got accepted\n\n* Tested (Open) Beta/Alpha or any non live version of VRChat",
