      "value": "Groups could also have their own Milestones for their members.\n\nGroups themselves could set the Milestones using an interface on the website, in the Group management part of the website.\n\nUsing parameters such as\n\n- The amount of time spent in this group\n\n- The amount of time spent in this group instances",
