  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So we know that \"Achievements\" tab appeared on accident in the beta client and got removed. \n\nTupper said \"What could achievements even be ?\"\n\nHence, I present.. \"VRChat Journey Milestones\" \n\nWhy this name ?\n\nIt sounds less like a competitive system and more like a story progression.\n\nMilestones could be for example:\n\n- \"Visit a world for the first time\"\n\n- \"Change your avatar for the first time\"\n\n- \"Visit 100 Unique VRChat Worlds\"\n\n- \"Make a friend\"\n\n- \"Make 100 friends\"\n\n- \"Upload an avatar\"\n\n- \"Upload a world\"\n\n- \"Have 1,000 people visit your world\"\n\n- \"Become a Known User\"\n\n- \"Join a group\"\n\n- \"Select a language that you speak in your bio\"\n\nAlso seasonal milestones, such as\n\n- \"Visit Vket 2023\"\n\nMilestones could give Milestone Points, that could give rewards like specific icons, badges,maybe even titles.\n\nMilestones could be also used to guide new players through discovering features and worlds.\n\nFor example:\n\n- Proggresive milestone \"VRChat Classics\" that would make you visit classic worlds like The Great Pug, The Black Cat, etc\n\n- Milestone called \"Why don't I see your avatar ?\" making you play around with the safety shield settings\"\n\netc",
